		<item>
			<title>Kris Thykier: 'Madonna works harder than anyone I've met'</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/143-kris-thykier-madonna-works-harder-than-anyone-ive-met.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/143-kris-thykier-madonna-works-harder-than-anyone-ive-met.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>Film producer <strong>Kris Thykier</strong> is behind two of the year's biggest  Brit flicks: The Debt and <strong>Madonna's W.E.</strong></p>
<p> </p>
<p>"<strong>Madonna</strong> works harder than anyone I've met," <strong>Kris Thykier</strong> told GQ. "You don't always know what you're getting with a big name, but she was the last one on set [of her film <strong>W.E.</strong>] every night and kept the crew going when they were exhausted."</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Being into the film industry, <strong>Thykier</strong> handled the marketing of some fantastic films, such as Four Weddings And A Funeral and Lock, Stock And Two Smoking Barrels directed by <strong>Madonna</strong>'s former husband Guy Ritchie.</p></div>]]></description>
